WHAT CAME FROM UPSTREAM
-----------------------

skills/no-ai-slop/SKILL.md
    The editing principles, the words-to-cut lists and the patterns-to-cut
    catalog are Peter Yang's, reproduced with light edits. The channel router
    section and the front matter are new. The file carries a provenance header.

skills/no-ai-slop/eval.md
    Reproduced from upstream with the channel checks appended. The file carries
    a provenance header.

scripts/slop_lint.py
    New code. The pattern names, the banned-word list, the empty-phrase list
    and the definitions of each slop pattern are taken from upstream's
    SKILL.md and encoded as regular expressions.


